00:04:01.167 --> 00:04:05.501
I think there's a sniper --
There's a sniper in the --

00:04:05.501 --> 00:04:09.100
What in the...
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:11.300 --> 00:04:14.167
Wow!
-Oh, my God.

00:04:14.167 --> 00:04:15.434
-That's a good look.
-Thank you.

00:04:15.434 --> 00:04:16.634
-Oh, my God.

00:04:16.634 --> 00:04:19.100
-Alright, ready?
-Oh, wow.

00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:20.467
-Odds are back in your favor.
-This is my future.

00:04:20.467 --> 00:04:21.701
This is my future.

00:04:21.701 --> 00:04:22.767
-Ooh, what are the odds?
What are the odds?

00:04:22.767 --> 00:04:23.901
-Oh, man.
-What are the odds?

00:04:23.901 --> 00:04:26.133
-What are the odds?
[ Breathes deeply ]

00:04:26.133 --> 00:04:27.634
Um...

00:04:27.634 --> 00:04:29.968
